{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/537902-change-is-coming-now-what","id":537902,"title":"Change is coming! Now what?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-03T01:51:12-07:00","id":537902,"title":"Change is coming! Now what?","content":"Hey all!<br /> <br /> <br /> I have been running a Werewolf 2nd edition game for a while now. but with Wolfblooded as the main focus.<br /> <br /> I have player is interested in becoming Uratha. This has been in the cards for a while, and I have been thinking when the time is right.<br /> <br /> I want this to be a memorable moment for the player, something she can look back at and remember as a milestone for her character.<br /> I'm looking for ideas for a cool narrative or a story focusing on her change. I want this to be all about the feeling of changing; becoming something more than human.<br /> <br /> <br /> Any thoughts?<br /> <br /> If you need details just tell me! :-)<br /> <br /> While I am at it:<br /> Should a tell from a wolf bloooded be translated into something on a Werewolf character sheet? or is it something that just dissapears? I mean, unless it is paid for in experience, there is no reason it should be moved, right?<br /> <br /> Any and all thoughts are appreciated!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/860-ephraim","name":"Ephraim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar860_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T03:14:35-07:00","id":537965,"title":"","content":"Generally speaking a lot of tells are werewolf abilities anyway. Your wolf blooded could turn into a wolf? Congratulations! You can ... still do that. Extra ones are subject to sanctity of merits so I'd just swap out for similar werewolf merits. Liars Skin to Fortified Form seems an obvious one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T09:55:07-07:00","id":538501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephraim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/537902-change-is-coming-now-what#post537902\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey all!<br /> <br /> <br /> I have been running a Werewolf 2nd edition game for a while now. but with Wolfblooded as the main focus.<br /> <br /> I have player is interested in becoming Uratha. This has been in the cards for a while, and I have been thinking when the time is right.<br /> <br /> I want this to be a memorable moment for the player, something she can look back at and remember as a milestone for her character.<br /> I'm looking for ideas for a cool narrative or a story focusing on her change. I want this to be all about the feeling of changing; becoming something more than human.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>It should be an ordeal. Something would be wrong with the blooded, without other Uratha or more knowledgeable Wolfblooded around, the signs of the impending change might go unnoticed, with the symptoms making the character seem haunted.<br /> <br /> Show, don't tell.<br /> <br /> If people can see into twilight, have instead spirits use reaching to mess with him or her. Or have spirits specifically target him or her for possession. It should all reach to a boiling point where the character snaps to the stress in the climax and changes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T12:14:21-07:00","id":538667,"title":"","content":"You could use the Tension Pool mechanic from the storytelling chapter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-03T23:02:05-07:00","id":539261,"title":"","content":"Charlaquin: Yeah I like the Tension Pool. it will be fun to play out.<br /> <br /> Ephsy: That is an amazing idea.It works perfectly with the tension pool. Also it fits the character. She is the offspring of a spirit and a human (more for flavor than anything). There is one spirit in particular that has an axe to grind with the character, and it does have some scary spirit allies.<br /> <br /> Elfive: Spot on. She has just bought her second tell though, which I think should be paid back in experience when she turns.<br /> <br /> Thanks for this one, all of you! This will be fun. :-)<br /> I will keep you posted on how it all turns out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/860-ephraim","name":"Ephraim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar860_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}